quest obelisk~
Object - to take your group and seek out the clues for your team, put them together to form the short poem and be the first to tell Corwin what your
poem is. To tell Corwin the answer for your team use Mudmail ONLY.

Rules - no PK of other questers to slow them down or rob them is permitted
Rules - No holding of other teams clues is permitted but you may make a note
of the content of their clue(s) and dest them. Removing other team's clues
    from the game IS permitted as a tactic.
Rules You must mudmail me your team member's names and your team leader.
Rules - You may not recall or summon other teams away from their searches but
of course you may track them without using follow command.
Bonus - After you have sent me the answer for your team and I have mudmailed
    you back to say its right you may then proceed to try to solve the other
    teams poems. Each additional poem you solve ups your prize IF you are
    the first to send in your own poem correctly. You may keep solving other
    teams poems until the Quest time limit is up.
Time limit - This quest will last 3 days...72 hours from start time.
Prizes - each team member will receive an equal share of prize(s) no MVP awards
~
